[h1]Project Vigilance: Thermal Integrity & Materials[/h1]
[b]Programmatic startup flammability audit eliminating unrealistic combustion of solid metals, stonework, heavy steel bridges, machinery, and sensory radar dishes — without fragile XML patches.[/b]
Requires [i]Project Vigilance - Core Framework[/i]. Standalone — works with or without other Project Vigilance modules. Safe to add or remove mid-save.
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Key Features[/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]Non-Combustible Structural & Precious Metals:[/b] Sets raw item flammability and Stuff flammability factors to 0% for [i]Steel[/i], [i]Plasteel[/i], [i]Gold[/i], [i]Silver[/i], and [i]Uranium[/i] — steel walls, doors, and metal stockpiles no longer catch fire from burning grass.
[*] [b]All-Metal Machinery & Sensory Hardware Audit:[/b] Automatically calibrates fixed-recipe metal and stone structures ([i]Electric Smelter[/i], [i]Machining Table[/i], [i]Fabrication Bench[/i], [i]Autocannon Turret[/i], [i]Power Switch[/i], [i]Hopper[/i], [i]Signal Jammer[/i], and Project Vigilance radar/sonar dishes) to 0% flammability.
[*] [b]Intentional Hazards Preserved:[/b] Chemical [i]Batteries[/i] retain thermal-runaway flammability, wooden [i]Bridges[/i] burn at 100%, and [i]Bioferrite[/i] structures remain combustible.
[*] [b]Odyssey Bridge & Gravship Hull Calibration:[/b] Heavy steel bridges, ancient heavy bridges, and substructures are non-combustible (0%), while Odyssey [i]Gravship Hull[/i] flammability is governed cleanly by its construction Stuff (metal hulls 0%, Bioferrite hulls 75%).
[*] [b]Runtime Toggle:[/b] Can be toggled directly under the unified [i]Project Vigilance[/i] Mod Options -> [i]Thermal[/i] tab.
[/list]
[hr][/hr]
[h2]Compatibility & Load Order[/h2]
[olist]
[*] Harmony
[*] Core & Official DLCs (Odyssey, Anomaly, Biotech, Ideology, Royalty — all optional)
[*] Project Vigilance - Core Framework
[*] [b]Project Vigilance - Thermal Integrity & Materials[/b]
[/olist]
